        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city has 4 different tribes and they fear each other. You need to build housing, commercial, and community buildings for them, and keep them happy.<br><br>Plots of land come with their own planning restrictions. Sometimes, they contain natural resources for you to extract, then make materials in factories. Other times, you can build on them, but not all buildings are allowed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/9ba4ca43897e4a5b108f33814f13e870.avif?t=1765348778\" width=930 height=473 /></span><br><br>How you play is up to you. The more you build, the more your city expands. You can create areas for one tribes, or you can create shared buildings.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/8f66eae431ca83b992cda7db365a894c.avif?t=1765348778\" width=930 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host events in your community buildings, residents like those!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the tribes power ups, the special building power ups, the special events power ups, and the upgrade tokens. But be careful, you might trigger disasters!<br><br>Different views allow you to view the information you need to know to plan your city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/e6ade388d8bcd4739d9e1c7d1cf33193.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/1cae1273ed4338cad7ecaf68aa59ea28.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/84060b0cea2a4e53ddd1bf6bf2698ad8.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><br><br>Can you keep your residents happy, and your city's finances afloat?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/6e1afae8dfd45e4d39c2581995568523.avif?t=1765348778\" width=210 height=179 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city has 4 different tribes and they fear each other. You need to build housing, commercial, and community buildings for them, and keep them happy.<br><br>Plots of land come with their own planning restrictions. Sometimes, they contain natural resources for you to extract, then make materials in factories. Other times, you can build on them, but not all buildings are allowed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/9ba4ca43897e4a5b108f33814f13e870.avif?t=1765348778\" width=930 height=473 /></span><br><br>How you play is up to you. The more you build, the more your city expands. You can create areas for one tribes, or you can create shared buildings.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/8f66eae431ca83b992cda7db365a894c.avif?t=1765348778\" width=930 height=473 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host events in your community buildings, residents like those!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the tribes power ups, the special building power ups, the special events power ups, and the upgrade tokens. But be careful, you might trigger disasters!<br><br>Different views allow you to view the information you need to know to plan your city.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/e6ade388d8bcd4739d9e1c7d1cf33193.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/1cae1273ed4338cad7ecaf68aa59ea28.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/84060b0cea2a4e53ddd1bf6bf2698ad8.avif?t=1765348778\" width=882 height=491 /></span><br><br>Can you keep your residents happy, and your city's finances afloat?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858940/extras/6e1afae8dfd45e4d39c2581995568523.avif?t=1765348778\" width=210 height=179 /></span></p>",
